#/-------------------[DOTENV_PUBLIC_KEY]--------------------/
#/            public-key encryption for .env files          /
#/       [how it works](https://dotenvx.com/encryption)     /
#/----------------------------------------------------------/
DOTENV_PUBLIC_KEY_LOCAL_ENC="03f99d3fffc44e36231ad0014c70a8a18ab78282687ba08c9d44319e91804ce089"

# .env.local.enc
# Local development values for the web app. Key order mirrors .env.example.
#
# Production does not read this file — Vercel injects the same keys from project
# settings, and `next build` deliberately runs outside dotenvx so a build never
# depends on a private key being present.
#
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN is intentionally absent: it is a build-time-only secret that
# lives in Vercel, and nothing local uploads source maps.

# ─── NestJS API (apps/api) ────────────────────────
# The only backend. There is no DATABASE_URL here on purpose — the web app has no
# database access, and an ESLint rule blocks importing @repo/db.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="encrypted:BH4lBLp71xO9OibjVcqIFchzgGPdpprzqSnVEPFdRKYpnI7dltc5AuvU50DKYZIpL6kNmyJrmuwosrDp80g0z4TeZVwE+WzohxLXq2h0pnHERUAsMq7NDdTqV6xed0pU0tal8u4/lASYKt2KhoYzOUEcgDOtyg=="

# ─── PostHog ──────────────────────────────────────
# Product analytics runs in the browser only — see DECISIONS.md. The `phc_` project
# token is a write-only ingest key and is inlined into the client bundle by design;
# it is encrypted here for consistency, not because exposure would matter.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST is the *UI* origin, used for toolbar and dashboard links.
# Ingest goes through the /ingest rewrite in next.config.ts to survive adblockers.
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=encrypted:BBJwt2YaHtk32aNkAacyx1peaNIRgLZSzUVua3QmTYHML6kdKSgCinM/DC0n8WSpxHEwkWGSJhJ9AHXBN1ijcHpsaNoJK7HA6LHCa4DGQn/UcaLjFjqOkzL1dfLuIn8hW7O/xlHsboUoOmLnGHk2XR6v2du3QBpGmvDwb6fp/BuyNEgQI0gieIOB6dBtPnaseg==
NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=encrypted:BBG3elKco7kW3qKGMHXAug6nafRkpqphfd2QwIDK1UMJ9kHeQL02o197vuXn+ltfcnn3rxgfgUce6GlzpSirldZxo4Psk+6bM1HFwVdMJmzTPLrDV6xTv1dKM4/GYqyoFzCOWjvyWuEEluWWCuBjVlSIsJlzX+c=

